# HERCULE AI Operating System

<p align="center">

# HERCULE

Next Generation Artificial Intelligence Operating System

</p>

---

## Vision

HERCULE is a modular Artificial Intelligence Operating System designed to become a complete intelligent platform capable of reasoning, planning, learning, automation, engineering, robotics, perception, and autonomous execution using local Large Language Models.

The project is built around modular components so every subsystem can evolve independently while remaining connected through the Orchestrator.

---

# Core Architecture

```
Brain
        │
        ▼
Orchestrator
        │
        ▼
Kernel
        │
        ▼
Memory
Knowledge
Models
Abilities
Perception
Communication
Security
System
```

